                                                "text": "2016 October 17, Vicky Spratt, \"Work Hard, Work Hard:Meet The Neo-Puritans\", Graziadaily.cohttp://graziadaily.co.uk/life/real-life/work-hard-work-hard-meet-neo-puritans\nSome have argued that the closure of Fabric is symptomatic of a wider shift towards a new puritanism in Britain: a culture in which fun, hedonism and cultural experimentation are no longer valued."
